-- - mar-del-plata-offshore: Searched: Buenos Aires Province fisheries directorate pages say a provincial sport-fishing licence is required and mention both continental and marine/estuarine waters, but do not say whether it applies to sea shore or boat fishing at Mar del Plata; the regulation text is on a Google Drive link. The existing line "No licence is required for sea fishing in most Argentine coastal provinces" may therefore be wrong for Buenos Aires Province but is NOT verified either way. Follow-up worth doing.
